  "prefLabel": "Eth 102.03 Classified employee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 102.03 “Classified employee” means any state employee whose position is part of the state classification system maintained by the department of administrative services, as listed at https://das.nh.gov/HRJobClassifications/ClassSpecifications.aspx.\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
